[?2004l[?2004h> """
[?2004lr[?2004h> Parallel TF-IDF Implementation
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004la[?2004h> Parallelizes the TF-IDF index building and search operations:
[?2004l[?2004h> - Indexing: Uses ProcessPoolExecutor with chunked batches to reduce pickling overhead
[?2004l[?2004h> - Search: Uses ThreadPoolExecutor for efficient query parallelization
[?2004l[?2004h> """
